{"@context":"https://flpgiacomini.github.io/atlas/context/v2.jsonld","id":"atlas:event:policy-scale-and-electric-trade-2022-2024","type":"Event","name":"Política, escala e comércio elétrico: 2022–2024","aliases":["Do Fit for 55 às tarifas europeias"],"description":"Metas climáticas, incentivos industriais, milhões de novos elétricos e disputas comerciais mostram que a transição já reorganiza políticas públicas e cadeias globais.","claims":[{"id":"atlas:claim:eu-2035-political-agreement-2022","type":"Claim","subject":"atlas:event:policy-scale-and-electric-trade-2022-2024","predicate":"began-on","object":{"type":"date","value":"2022-10-27","precision":"day"},"sources":["atlas:source:eu-fit-for-55-agreement-2022"],"evidence":["atlas:evidence:eu-2035-agreement-2022"],"confidence":"high","validity":{"from":"2022-10-27","until":"2022-10-27","precision":"day"}},{"id":"atlas:claim:global-ev-sales-2023","type":"Claim","subject":"atlas:event:policy-scale-and-electric-trade-2022-2024","predicate":"involved","object":"Quase 14 milhões de automóveis elétricos novos foram registrados globalmente em 2023, equivalentes a aproximadamente 18% das vendas.","sources":["atlas:source:iea-global-ev-outlook-2024"],"evidence":["atlas:evidence:iea-ev-registrations-2023"],"confidence":"high","validity":{"from":"2023","until":"2023","precision":"year"}},{"id":"atlas:claim:eu-bev-duties-2024","type":"Claim","subject":"atlas:event:policy-scale-and-electric-trade-2022-2024","predicate":"ended-on","object":{"type":"date","value":"2024-10-30","precision":"day"},"sources":["atlas:source:eu-bev-duties-2024","atlas:source:iea-global-ev-outlook-2025"],"evidence":["atlas:evidence:eu-duties-china-2024","atlas:evidence:iea-ev-sales-2024"],"confidence":"high","validity":{"from":"2024","until":"2024-10-30","precision":"day"}}],"sources":[{"id":"atlas:source:eu-fit-for-55-agreement-2022","type":"Source","title":"First Fit for 55 proposal agreed: CO2 emissions for new cars and vans","publisher":"Council of the European Union","url":"https://www.consilium.europa.eu/en/press/press-releases/2022/10/27/first-fit-for-55-proposal-agreed-the-eu-strengthens-targets-for-co2-emissions-for-new-cars-and-vans/","trust":"government","verifiedAt":"2026-08-24"},{"id":"atlas:source:iea-global-ev-outlook-2024","type":"Source","title":"Global EV Outlook 2024 — Trends in electric cars","publisher":"International Energy Agency","url":"https://www.iea.org/reports/global-ev-outlook-2024/trends-in-electric-cars","trust":"intergovernmental","verifiedAt":"2026-08-24"},{"id":"atlas:source:eu-bev-duties-2024","type":"Source","title":"EU imposes duties on unfairly subsidised electric vehicles from China","publisher":"European Commission","url":"https://ec.europa.eu/commission/presscorner/api/files/document/print/en/ip_24_5589/IP_24_5589_EN.pdf","trust":"government","verifiedAt":"2026-08-24"},{"id":"atlas:source:iea-global-ev-outlook-2025","type":"Source","title":"Global EV Outlook 2025 — Trends in electric car markets","publisher":"International Energy Agency","url":"https://www.iea.org/reports/global-ev-outlook-2025/trends-in-electric-car-markets-2","trust":"intergovernmental","verifiedAt":"2026-08-24"}],"evidence":[{"id":"atlas:evidence:eu-2035-agreement-2022","type":"Evidence","source":"atlas:source:eu-fit-for-55-agreement-2022","evidenceType":"political-agreement","locator":{"date":"2022-10-27"},"notes":"Conselho e Parlamento alcançaram acordo político provisório para redução de 100% das emissões de CO2 de automóveis e vans novos em 2035; a adoção formal ocorreria depois."},{"id":"atlas:evidence:iea-ev-registrations-2023","type":"Evidence","source":"atlas:source:iea-global-ev-outlook-2024","evidenceType":"intergovernmental-statistics","locator":{"year":"2023"},"notes":"A IEA registra quase 14 milhões de novos elétricos e participação aproximada de 18% em 2023."},{"id":"atlas:evidence:eu-duties-china-2024","type":"Evidence","source":"atlas:source:eu-bev-duties-2024","evidenceType":"trade-measure","locator":{"date":"2024-10-29"},"notes":"A Comissão concluiu a investigação antissubsídios e impôs direitos compensatórios definitivos por cinco anos."},{"id":"atlas:evidence:iea-ev-sales-2024","type":"Evidence","source":"atlas:source:iea-global-ev-outlook-2025","evidenceType":"intergovernmental-statistics","locator":{"year":"2024"},"notes":"A IEA consolidou mais de 17 milhões de elétricos vendidos em 2024, acima de 20% do mercado global."}],"metadata":{"editorial_level":"editorial","editorial_batch":"V2-2020S-02","region_cluster":"Mundo 2020-2026","reviewed_at":"2026-08-24","temporal_status":"confirmed"}}
